# Assets Directory

This directory contains assets that are bundled into the APK.

## sing-box binary

The `sing-box` binary is downloaded during CI build from:
https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/releases/download/v1.10.7/sing-box-1.10.7-android-arm64.tar.gz

It is NOT committed to the repository. The GitHub Actions workflow downloads it
automatically before building the APK.

If building locally, download the Android ARM64 binary manually and place it here as `sing-box`.
